{"id":"n29721-1-15","stage":1,"title":"맛없다 · 不好吃","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29721-1-15-1","ko":"어제 그 식당 음식 어땠어?","zh":"昨天那家餐厅的菜怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"식당","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅。","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}},{"text":"음식","meaning":"饮食，饭菜","explanation":"음식：饮食，饭菜。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어","audio":"/audio/fd7f0c90fa72bdb46939.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"fe047fb6c566f277","term":"식당","zh":"饭店，餐厅","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3","entryId":"36693","definition":"制做并出售食物的商店。","pronunciation":["식땅"]},{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"饮食，饭菜","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"饭、汤等人们每顿食用的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/ed57d0ba2b21145f5773.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29721-1-15-2","ko":"비싼 돈을 주고 그렇게 맛없는 음식을 먹다니, 돈이 아깝더라.","zh":"花那么多钱却吃到那么难吃的菜，真是太浪费钱了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비싼","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비싼","audio":"/audio/f6b099752cceba2e2349.mp3"}},{"text":"돈을","meaning":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","explanation":"돈：钱，钱款，价钱，费用；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"2","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈을","audio":"/audio/658b47180707ddf8eb38.mp3"}},{"text":"주고","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주고","audio":"/audio/c510b47c8539f2fdcb5a.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그렇게：“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36292","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"맛없는","meaning":"不好吃，没味道，无味","explanation":"맛없다：不好吃，没味道，无味；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"맛없다","audio":"/audio/039760c04c09d00a70e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29721","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛없는","audio":"/audio/32dfd461382a604f3c77.mp3"}},{"text":"음식을","meaning":"食物，食品","explanation":"음식：食物，食品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"2","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식을","audio":"/audio/9ea9d415f3b4255ca9e5.mp3"}},{"text":"먹다니,","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；다니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹다니","audio":"/audio/bfd79506a78e6f8a1330.mp3"}},{"text":"돈이","meaning":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","explanation":"돈：钱，钱款，价钱，费用；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"2","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈이","audio":"/audio/6fc43b50168ec9dd1ba6.mp3"}},{"text":"아깝더라.","meaning":"可惜，心疼","explanation":"아깝다：可惜，心疼；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"아깝다","audio":"/audio/12194e98cc6edbd899e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24398","senseId":"1","lemma":"아깝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아깝더라","audio":"/audio/434063eb42017a576846.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"063c1a7bb93233dc","term":"비싸다","zh":"贵","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3","entryId":"66318","definition":"物品的价格或做某事所花的费用高于一般水平。","pronunciation":["비싸다"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"购物或做某事时所需的钱财。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"b470a873a66143d2","term":"그렇게","zh":"“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3","entryId":"36292","definition":"“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"039760c04c09d00a","term":"맛없다","zh":"不好吃，没味道，无味","audio":"/audio/039760c04c09d00a70e6.mp3","entryId":"29721","definition":"食物的味道不好。","pronunciation":["마덥따"]},{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"食物，食品","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"可供人们吃喝的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"12194e98cc6edbd8","term":"아깝다","zh":"可惜，心疼","audio":"/audio/12194e98cc6edbd899e3.mp3","entryId":"24398","definition":"失去了珍贵的东西而感到遗憾。","pronunciation":["아깝따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e5b6fc57ad298a86f63a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.907,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29721","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":57,"sequenceScore":2.6323,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["昨天那家餐厅的菜怎么样？","花那么多钱却吃到那么难吃的菜，真是太浪费钱了。","为什么车会往一边倾啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["昨天那家餐厅的菜怎么样？","花那么多钱却吃到那么难吃的菜，真是太浪费钱了。","为什么车会往一边倾啊？"],"answer":1}]}
